MODULE: RepairFailedWriteMemoized
TARGET: CompletionDurable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: failed completion persistence leaves a success-shaped in-memory result
PERTURBS: PersistFailure

--- FIND
PersistFailure ==
    /\ Live /\ faults < MaxFaults
    /\ ((decided /\ ~applied /\ stage = One) \/
        (repairDecided /\ ~repairApplied /\ stage = [v \in Views |-> 2]))
    /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ reported' = [reported EXCEPT !["original"] = applied, !["repair"] = repairApplied]
--- REPLACE
PersistFailure ==
    /\ Live /\ faults < MaxFaults
    /\ ((decided /\ ~applied /\ stage = One) \/
        (repairDecided /\ ~repairApplied /\ stage = [v \in Views |-> 2]))
    /\ faults' = faults + 1
    /\ reported' = [k \in {"original","repair"} |-> TRUE]
--- END
